// REFACTOR:grounded (MR10): shared executable Task request control.
library "Task Request Fixture".
concept "Ready":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `ready`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
decision "Review":
first:
- when "Ready" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".
activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
- with `Ready for review.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
activity "Notify":
- request CPGTaskRequest.
- with `Send the review result.`.
activity "Do not notify":
- request do not perform CPGTaskRequest.
- with `Do not send the review result.`.
